Output demo/primordium-demo.gif
Output demo/primordium-demo.mp4

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Theme "TokyoNight"
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Framerate 30

Hide
Type "cd REPO_ROOT"
Enter
Show

Type "# PRIMORDIUM — Brainfuck symbiogenesis (BFF-inspired)"
Sleep 1s

Type "PRIMORDIUM_BIN validate configs/template_quick.yaml"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "PRIMORDIUM_BIN run configs/template_quick.yaml"
Enter
Sleep 5s

Type "./scripts/demo_analyse_last.sh"
Enter
Sleep 3s
